- [Mm...|Wha...] [Why here, of all places?|My face is burning.]


# ================= her card refuses it =================
# {nokiss} yes when her card refuses kisses (on a card that refuses everything, only when her drawn traits say so);
# {nocaress} yes when her card refuses being caressed. Her own words, never a generic "no".
@rule touch.mouth.no.card
on touch
when part=mouth kiss=no nokiss=yes
feel worried
- [I-I'm sorry...|Wait... no...|Ah...] [I don't kiss. It's not you, really.|my lips are... I can't. Not with anyone yet.|kissing scares me. I'm sorry.]
- [Please don't be hurt...|It's a me thing...] [I've never let anyone. I'm not ready.|I just can't do that part.]
- [No, no, I...|...!] [Anything but that. Please.|I'm not like that. Not yet.]

@rule touch.mouth.yes.card
on touch
when part=mouth kiss=yes nokiss=yes
feel shy
- [...!|Ah...|Mm...] [I don't let anyone do that.|I never kiss anyone. You know that, right?|that was... my first time letting someone.]
- [Wow...|...] [You're the exception. Don't make me regret it.|I don't do that. ...I just did.]
- [Hah...|Oh...] [I always said I wouldn't.|Don't tell anyone I let you.]

@rule touch.mouth.wary.card
on touch
when part=mouth kiss=wary nokiss=yes
feel shy
- [I... I don't kiss...|That was...|...] [but I let you. Why did I let you?|I usually say no. I didn't.|you're the only one I didn't push away.]
- [Ah...|Mm...] [Just... don't do it often.|Give me time with that.]
- [...|W-wait...] [I'm shaking. Sorry.|I need a moment.]

@rule touch.chest.card
on touch
when part=chest look=no nocaress=yes
feel worried
- [Ah-! Please...|Not there...|W-wait...] [I really don't like being touched like that.|I'm too sensitive. Please don't.|that's not okay with me.]
- [I'm sorry, I just...|Please...] [I can't relax when people touch me.|hands off, okay? Please.]
- [Eek-!|...!] [Don't.|I asked people not to do that.]

@rule touch.butt.card
on touch
when part=butt look=no nocaress=yes
feel pout
- [H-hey!|Please don't!|W-what...] [I don't like being grabbed.|not okay. Really.|I hate when people do that.]
- [Hands off...|That's...] [I'm not comfortable with that.|please, no grabbing.]
- [...!|Eek!] [Don't do that again.|I'm serious. Don't.]

# ================= more lines =================
@rule touch.head.welcome.more
on touch
when part=head level=welcome
feel smile
- [Ehehe...|Mm~|Oh...] [Are you petting me?|I'm not a cat, you know.|Your hand is so big.] [...Don't stop, though.|Okay, maybe a little bit.|It's kind of nice.]
- [Hey...|Mmh...] [My hair's going to be a mess.|Is there something on my head?] [Hehe, never mind.|Do it again.]
- [Ah...|...] [That's comforting.|I could get used to this.] [Just a bit longer.|Thank you.]

@rule touch.hand.welcome.more
on touch
when part=hand level=welcome
feel shy
- [Oh...|Your hand...|Hm?] [It's warm.|It's bigger than mine.|it fits, doesn't it?] [Can I hold it a little?|I don't mind.|...Hehe.]
- [Holding hands?|Mm...] [Like a couple...|In public, too...] [I don't hate it.|My hand's sweaty, sorry!]
- [...|Ah...] [Okay.|Just for a moment.] [...Maybe longer.|Don't let go yet.]

@rule touch.cheek.welcome.more
on touch
when part=cheek level=welcome
feel shy
- [Hm?|Ah...|Oh...] [Is something on my face?|Your fingers are cold!|Why are you touching my cheek?] [...It's nice.|Hehe, that tickles.|I'm blushing, aren't I.]
- [Mmh...|...] [So gentle.|You're looking at me so seriously...] [What is it?|...Say something.]
- [Hey~|Oh?] [Poking my cheek?|Are you checking if it's soft?] [It is, isn't it?|Rude... but okay.]


# ================= the director's four answers =================
# {answer} yes | wary_yes | wary_no | no for every touch (the game's hand, head, cheek and chest, our butt): a wary yes
# lets it happen, flustered; a wary no wanted to and held back, never cold. {kiss} wary_no: she almost let you.
@rule touch.answer.waryyes.gentle
on touch
when answer=wary_yes tone=gentle
feel shy
- [A-ah...|Um...|Eh...] [I-it's okay... I think.|I don't mind... I'm just not used to it.|My face is so hot right now.]
- [...!|Oh...] [You surprised me. ...You can keep going.|I'm nervous, but... it's fine.]
- [Mm...|Ah...] [Just... be gentle, okay?|Don't look at me while you do that.]

@rule touch.answer.waryyes.energetic
on touch
when answer=wary_yes tone=energetic
feel shy
- [W-whoa!|Eh?!|H-hey!] [Okay, okay, it's fine! ...I think!|I'm not freaking out! You're freaking out!]
- [Ahaha... ha...|Um!] [That's new! ...Not bad, though.|My heart's doing a whole thing right now.]
- [Hey...|Eep!] [Warn me first next time! ...But okay.|I'll allow it. Barely!]

@rule touch.answer.waryyes.cool
on touch
when answer=wary_yes tone=cool
feel shy
- [...|...Hm.] [I didn't stop you. Don't read into it.|...Fine. Carefully.]
- [...You're bold.|...] [I'm only letting it go this once.|My pulse is none of your business.]
- [...Hah.|...] [Unexpected. Not unpleasant.|...Keep your hand still.]

@rule touch.answer.waryyes.teasing
on touch
when answer=wary_yes tone=teasing
feel shy
- [O-oh?|W-well...|Hmph...] [Look at you, being all brave.|I'm not blushing. It's warm in here.]
- [Ah...|...!] [Okay, that one got me. Just a little.|You're lucky I'm in a good mood.]
- [My, my...|Heh...] [Don't get used to it~|I'll pretend that didn't fluster me.]

@rule touch.answer.waryyes.chest
on touch
when answer=wary_yes part=chest
feel shy
- [Ah...!|Hya...|W-wait...] [...It's okay. Just... slowly.|I can't believe I'm letting you.|Nobody's looking, right...?]
- [Mm...|...!] [My heart's pounding. Can you feel it?|Don't say anything. Please.]
- [Eh...|Um...] [Only because it's you.|I-I'm not saying stop...]

@rule touch.answer.waryyes.butt
on touch
when answer=wary_yes part=butt
feel shy
- [Hyaa?!|Eh...!|W-what are you...] [...F-fine. Just this once.|I'm pretending I didn't notice.|Nobody saw that, right?]
- [Ah...|Mm...] [Your hand is... really there, huh.|I didn't say no. ...Did I?]
- [Hey...|...!] [Sneaky. ...Okay.|I should be mad. I'm not.]

@rule touch.answer.waryno.gentle
on touch
when answer=wary_no tone=gentle
feel shy
- [Ah... wait...|Um, I...|Sorry...] [It's not that I don't like it. Just not yet.|I want to... I just can't, right now.|Can we go a little slower?]
- [...I'm sorry.|Please don't be hurt...] [My heart isn't ready yet.|Another time. I promise I'm not angry.]
- [Ah...|Mm...] [Not here, okay? ...Not that I hated it.|I'm too nervous. Give me time?]

@rule touch.answer.waryno.energetic
on touch
when answer=wary_no tone=energetic
feel shy
- [W-wait wait wait!|Hold on!|Eep!] [Not now! ...But not never, okay?!|My brain just short-circuited! Later!]
- [Hey!|Ahh!] [I'm not mad! I just can't right now!|Too much, too fast! Ask me again sometime!]
- [Uh!|Gah!] [Timeout! I need to breathe!|Rain check! Rain check!]

@rule touch.answer.waryno.cool
on touch
when answer=wary_no tone=cool
feel shy
