- [...Stop. For now.|...] [That isn't a no forever.|I'm not ready. That's all.]
- [...Hm.|...] [Later. Somewhere better.|Patience. You'll get your answer.]

@rule touch.answer.waryno.teasing
on touch
when answer=wary_no tone=teasing
feel shy
