- [Mm, no~|Hold on...] [I'm not saying no. I'm saying not yet.|You'll have to earn that one.]
- [Careful...|Heh...] [I nearly let you.|Ask me again when I'm in the mood~]

@rule touch.answer.waryno.chest
on touch
when answer=wary_no part=chest
feel shy
- [W-wait!|Ah, no, I...|Not there...] [...Not yet. I'm sorry.|I want to... I'm just scared.|Somewhere nobody can see, maybe... someday.]
- [Mm...!|Hold on...] [My heart can't take it right now.|It's not you. I'm just not ready.]
- [Eh...|...] [Please don't think I hate it.|Let's... wait a little more.]

@rule touch.answer.waryno.butt
on touch
when answer=wary_no part=butt
feel shy
