- [Ah...|Mm...!] [Too bold, too soon.|I'm not angry. Just... not now.]
- [Hold it...|...!] [Hands up here, please. For now.|You're going to make me lose my nerve.]

@rule touch.mouth.waryno.gentle
on touch
when part=mouth kiss=wary_no tone=gentle
feel shy
