- [...!|Um...] [That was so close...|I'll be ready soon. I think.]
- [Mm...|Ah...] [Not here. Somewhere just us.|Let me keep this feeling a little longer.]

@rule touch.mouth.waryno.energetic
on touch
when part=mouth kiss=wary_no tone=energetic
feel shy
- [Whoa whoa whoa!|W-wait!|Eek!] [Not yet! But... soon, maybe?!|I almost did it! Ahh!]
- [Hey!|Ahh...] [My heart nearly exploded!|Rain check, okay?! A real one!]
- [Uh!|Gah!] [Give me a second to be brave!|Next time! I swear!]

@rule touch.mouth.waryno.cool
on touch
when part=mouth kiss=wary_no tone=cool
feel shy
