- [...Hah.|...] [That was closer than I meant to let it get.|Another day.]
- [...|...Hm.] [Don't look so disappointed. It's not a no.|Patience.]

@rule touch.mouth.waryno.teasing
on touch
when part=mouth kiss=wary_no tone=teasing
feel shy
